lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-02T14:26:16-08:00","id":798397,"title":"","content":"I've never quite gotten how one is supposed to play a child in WoD (or CoD as it now is); they have the same number of attribute points, but their skills are lower. Wouldn't that be the other way around? Certainly there's something to be said for age in regards to skills, but a ten year old child shouldn't be able to have 5 dots in Strength while an adult has 3.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-02T14:38:27-08:00","id":798401,"title":"","content":"I'm really not sure, I have not run<b> Innocents</b>. This is not due to any contempt for it, it is a great book. It's because I like romance and sex in stories enough, and often have places like nightclubs involved, it is harder for me to get into a kids thing.<br /> <br /> I will say Attributes don't mean quite the same thing for kids. 5 kid strength is not 5 adult strength.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-02T15:29:03-08:00","id":798427,"title":"","content":"Pretty much. Kid Attributes are downscaled. Also adults get 8-again on all actions against kids, good or bad.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/872434-shadow-knight-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\">My homebrew hub</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10056-shadowknight1224","name":"ShadowKnight1224","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"975"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-02T21:29:41-08:00","id":798972,"title":"","content":"I'm getting a little confused by now.<br /> Was the demon they captured responsible for all the lust/taboo shenanigans?<br /> When did Sara begin to like Angelique? Are all the sudden atttractions coming from an outside influence?<br /> <br /> Love having true prose from Natalie.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>When will you rage?","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1405-anteros","name":"Anteros","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1405_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-03T01:30:52-08:00","id":799160,"title":"","content":"It's unclear, but I will explain.<br /> <br /> The Bale Hound was using powers to essentially cause vices to dominate, which focused on Taboos. Angelique was initially affected, because she was weakened by the connection to the Maeljin, though Doc severed that. She did not really spread it to the PCs, but to her own pack, especially the Callahan Siblings.<br /> <br /> Bright Shadow then put some demons in the form of Beshilu, which fought some PCs in Sleeping Giant. They were killed, but affected those there, who spread the supernatural virus to their packs/Krewes. It is tied to Bright Shadow, without whom it will fade on it's own. Her intention is for each group to tear itself apart via power struggles and jealousies, and leave some Werewolves, including she hoped Angelique, ripe for corruption.<br /> <br /> Different PCs are vulnerable on different levels. Natalie and Sara are libertines, and their effect is minimal because they have fewer personal taboos. Most that they have is not sleeping with vulnerable people (like Angelique) or people in relationships (like Alice). Others are more susceptible, like Alice and Doc who are in fully monogamous relationships thus sleeping with anyone but their partner, even for fun, is a violation. Alexia is kinda of the middle, being less strictly monogamous than Doc or Alice but not the wild libidos that are Sara or Natalie.<br /> <br /> Sara has always liked Angelique. The pic for her is very attractive, so I think her player thinking she is hot is part of it. Angelique's involvement with Malard kept Sara at bay, though, as say what you will about Sara, she does not seek to damage relationships.<br /> <br /> Is that clearer?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" 