<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-11T12:52:42-07:00","id":912389,"title":"","content":"Is Doc's service dog roleplayed when he uses the Primeval key to talk with it, and is it considered a low level retainer of his? Odd questions, I know, but curiosity has struck me recently.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-12T01:29:16-07:00","id":912692,"title":"","content":"Taidragon&gt;Doc's player has handled interactions with his dog and generally controls him. I honestly cannot recall if he is a retainer or not.<br /> <br /> Now that they have targets, the Middle Shadows decide how to move against them. Most immediately, but determining how to unravel the secrets of Pup Pid<br /> <br /> <i>Session CLIX</i><br /> <br /> <b>Sara\u2019s Letters</b><br /> <br /> Doc came down for breakfast the next morning with a big smile on his face and greeted everyone brightly. His smile faded as he took in everyone else\u2019s expressions. The woman all looked at each other when he asked what was up, until Karen shrugged and answered.<br /> <br /> \u201cIt started, I\u2019ve discovered from talking to the police, with my parents protesting outside of our townhouse for a week.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cThe police? Protesting?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cThey and thirty members of their church want to pray my gay away.\u201d<br /> <br /> Doc was sputtering mad throughout the rest of the explanation. He did smile tightly and kiss Tavia on the top of her head when Sara described how the slight Fishbourne had shooed off the protestors. Discussion quickly turned to the triad\u2019s safety. Sara pouted teasingly when Karen asserted there would be less PDAs with the tattooed girl outside the house, since so far, Sara hadn\u2019t come under scrutiny by them. She frowned more seriously at Doc\u2019s suggestion she get a pistol.<br /> <br /> \u201cI don\u2019t need a gun to escape from harm. I wouldn\u2019t shoot them anyway.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cEven with a gun, Natalie probably shouldn\u2019t go out alone, or without someone menacing in particular. I mean, Noriko could eviscerate anyone causing problems but she\u2019s generally... not... m-\u201d<br /> <br /> Catherine swallowed hard as Noriko stared at her.<br /> <br /> \u201cUh, maybe Tatum\u2019s a better example.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI\u2019m an example!\u201d<br /> <br /> Doc pushed a little further on the gun issue, but since Natalie already had one and Karen wasn\u2019t old enough to own her pistol legally, it didn\u2019t go far. The conversation drifted towards more active solutions and Alexia spoke up.<br /> <br /> \u201cWhat if they had a bigger problem to deal with?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cOh, I can give them a bigger problem.\u201d<br /> <br /> Doc and Natalie growled that out simultaneously. Alexia\u2019s eyes widened and she waved her hands, explaining she meant trying to encourage them to get involved with the new Reverend. Karen frowned.<br /> <br /> \u201cThere are some good, if stupid people in that group. Some of them helped raise me. They think Natalie\u2019s a cult leader and are just trying to look out for me. I\u2019d rather they not get hurt either.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cSo, Natalie could convince them she\u2019s not! She could dress conservatively, with no makeup and deliver homemade cookies to sick kids, or something.\u201d<br /> <br /> Sara bit back a smile, eying Natalie with amusement. The strawberry scented woman gave her a stern look, before counter suggesting that she could disperse the protestors with a thunderstorm every time they showed up. Karen\u2019s suggestion that this wouldn\u2019t change their belief that Natalie was a witch got a shrug.<br /> <br /> \u201cWe could bug the church.\u201d<br /> <br /> Karen stared at Chandra dumbfounded, then turned the look on Doc when he pointed out he was planning on learning how to scry for that same purpose. Sara took her wife\u2019s hand, an apologetic look on her face.<br /> <br /> \u201cKnowing what they plan to do ahead of time can let us avoid conflict and make sure no one gets hurt.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cSo would hacking their emails! And that wouldn\u2019t violate the privacy of anyone that\u2019s not harassing us.\u201d<br /> <br /> Karen turned her frown on Sara, who nodded and shrugged. Doc, who had been looking intently thoughtful for a while, suggested getting Tracey, as a dream mage, to meddle with the protestors. It was Sara\u2019s turn to look dumbfounded.<br /> <br /> \u201cThe girl with the absolute power that you are so sure will absolutely corrupt her? You want to ask her to submit other people to her potentially mentally traumatic whimsy because they did something stupid that we disapprove of? The one who\u2019s the most in danger of becoming power mad?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cOK, maybe we could ask the Changelings, then.\u201d<br /> <br /> With tensions getting high, the conversation was steered towards Pup Pid for a time. They reached a consensus on the first step in that direction easily - Doc had the ability to summon the Pup Pid in the living world, since it was a spirit. Then they could acquire some sort of sympathetic link to the ghostly Pup Pid, at worst, and possibly also garner some hint as to the nature of the being.<br /> <br /> The rest was more complicated, since Natalie continued to be fixated on sending explosives at the ship. There was some argument as to how to safely tow the boat to shore, since Natalie\u2019s ward was stationary and the tug boat would, by necessity, be in motion. Somewhere into it, Alexia\u2019s eyes lit up.<br /> <br /> \u201cI could raise it using Industrial Marionette.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cAs long as you promise to go all Margaret Hamilton for it. Or a little \u2018Treguna Mekoides, Trecorum Satis Dee\u2019.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI\u2019m thinking Yoda.\u201d<br /> <br /> Natalie and Karen bickered goodnaturedly on the merits of their approaches. Meanwhile, Tatum looked unsurely at Natalie. <br /> <br /> \u201cThat chant is from a movie, right?\u201d<br /> <br /> Natalie started gently tapping her forehead to the table.<br /> <br /> They went over the details in depth, with Sara continuously having to steer Natalie away from Plans whose first step was \u2018fire an explosive at the ship\u2019. Their final plan, allowing for modifications that interrogating Pup Pid might lead to, was to have Alexia carry the bane gun inside her until it was needed, and after Jasmine illuminated the ship itself with Doc\u2019s ghost flashlights, raise it to a shallow enough area that the group could fight in. With any luck, Pup Pid would send a good sized contingent to stop the ship being dragged up, which Natalie could trap in a ward and the group could then blow them up, safely away from the ship. Hopefully then, the remaining crew would be manageable.<br /> <br /> That settled, talk turned back to living concerns. Tatum asked whether Karen and Natalie should carry GPS trackers, in case they were snatched. That brought up the Finding ritual, and prompted Doc to offer to teach Tatum his style of ritual magic. They discussed a couple of differences between Doc and Natalie\u2019s magics, with Karen pointing out she followed Doc\u2019s path when Tatum looked torn.<br /> <br /> \u201cOf course I went with luck magic. You\u2019ll notice I\u2019m sleeping with all these beautiful women.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cYou were sleeping with some of them before you learned luck magic.\u201d<br /> <br /> Natalie raised an eyebrow at Karen and smiled. They went back over the comfortable debate of sorcerer versus witch, with Karen giving over another bulletproof bit of logic.<br /> <br /> \u201cWell, I\u2019m not a Witch, and besides, I like putting on my robe and wizard hat...\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cLike Mickey?\u201d<br /> <br /> Karen gave Alexia a big smile while Sara tried not to laugh and Chandra looked slightly confused. Doc shook his head at all of them and Tavia offered to make sandwiches for lunch.<br /> <br /> -----------------------------------------------------------------------------<br /> <br /> The triad was lounging around together while Natalie prepared her ritual chalk with a few drops of human blood to help with the warding circles that would protect Alexia as she raised the ship. At some point, Doc and Alexia headed out to go shopping and shortly after, Natalie got a text from Doc, warning her that two men sitting in a car a few blocks down had binoculars trained on the road. Rage flashed over Natalie\u2019s face. Sara laid a hand on her arm and looked over at Karen.<br /> <br /> \u201cWhy don\u2019t you call Officer Norris? He can\u2019t arrest them for sitting in a parking lot, but he can encourage them to move along and it will go on the record and support your restraining orders.\u201d<br /> <br /> Karen nodded and made the call. Natalie took a deep breath and got back to what she was doing, albeit more distractedly. A little while later, once Karen was back, Sara\u2019s smile grew into a wicked grin.<br /> <br /> \u201cSo, Natalie, I know you disapprove of mind control, but... what about encouraging a fanatic\u2019s confidence? TO the point where he explains, honestly and with exacting detail, what his misguided campaign is about and what they are doing there on that corner to the police officer that comes to suggest he leave?\u201d<br /> <br /> Natalie began grinning to match Sara.<br /> <br /> <br /> Shortly before evening hit, the krewe gathered for Natalie\u2019s ritual of blessing. Once eventide, Pup Pid\u2019s usual domain, had arrived, Doc began the summoning. Natalie had sent Tatum out of the house for her safety, and Alexia had bowed out, given her fear of skeletons, but the rest of the krewe, as well as Angelique, Karen and Noriko, were all present.<br /> <br /> Natalie sat tailor style on the floor, her <i>was</i> in her lap, with Sara and Karen close. Sara glowed brightly with the light of her Pyre Flame Caul and Noriko was a small cat tucked away in a corner. Doc himself was in his canid form, towering over the ritual circle.<br /> <br /> After twenty minutes of summoning, and five of waiting, the skeletal pirate Pup Pid appeared, an ornate sword and pistol pair on his belt and scraps of rotted leather and cloth draped over his bones. He spoke in a low booming voice.<br /> <br /> \u201cWho summons the terror of the deep?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI do.\u201d<br /> <br /> Doc stepped up and gestured towards the offering of rum. Pup Pid crouched down and picked it up, downing the bottle. He wiped his mouth on his arm and asked why.<br /> <br /> \u201cInformation. I need to know about Pup Pid.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cPup Pid is the most dangerous pirate to ever sail the 7 Seas. His ship sank here, in a storm - only the Almighty himself could take Pup Pid. And now in death, only his own weapons can harm him. He hides in the dark waters, rising on the full moon to find his lost gold.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cWhat about his ship?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cIt is a powerful galleon, with four cannon and a high crow\u2019s nest. It has carried much booty.\u201d<br /> <br /> Sara looked closely and noted the pistol on the spirit\u2019s belt did resemble the pistol they\u2019d found. It was simply embellished, as the story the spirit was telling them surely was as well. She also noted that it had shown no sign of recognition of any of them, nor of Karen - Doc had theorized that perhaps Pup Pid was behind her feelings of being watched, but that didn\u2019t seem to be the case, especially as the spirit seemed uncertain it had ever been at the house before.<br /> <br /> Doc convinced the spirit to leave a token behind, ostensibly to make it easier to summon him for a golden reward. The ghost removed one of the tattered ribbons ending in a charred hunk of metal that had once been a medal plundered from an enemy.<br /> <br /> The spirit left quietly and once he\u2019d gone, the group relaxed. Karen grinned.<br /> <br /> \u201cSo now that we\u2019re done dealing with a ghost pirate, is it on to the plundering booty part of the evening?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI like that part of the evening.\u201d<br /> <br /> Sara smirked over at her.<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Natalie\u2019s Tweets</b><br /> <br /> December 9th, 2010<br /> <br /> Today was mostly planning. We got some things worked out.<br /> <br /> As far as Karen\u2019s parents, there was a sort of \u201cbuddy system\u201d suggested where I or Karen have someone with me when we go out. At first it was just someone intimidating, but there is no consensus on who is intimidating or to who, so I expect the \u201cbuddy system\u201d to fall apart in no time. I mean, who is going to go to exams with Karen and wait for hours? It is a good thought, but I doubt it will happen. I am frankly disgusted to think I need someone with me. I don\u2019t appreciate having my freedom curtailed.<br /> <br /> Some of the churchgoers, not Karen\u2019s parents, were lying in wake at the light off the highway to follow us, with binoculars and everything. Doc saw them and called back to the house, so Karen called the cops (not that they can do much) and Sara and I schemed to have a little fun with them. We wound up slipping up there and having me use Passion Marionette to embolden them a bit too much when the cops showed. No one would be hurt and they might get arrested and give us fodder for restraining orders.<br /> <br /> I only nudged them a bit, not made them do what they did not wish, that is not mind control, is it?<br /> <br /> I don\u2019t like what this is doing from me, mentally, morally or emotionally.<br /> <br /> In better news, we moved forward on Pup Pid. We are developing a solid plan for dealing with the critter. After much arguing where I wanted to blow up the ship, because I have never blown up a ghost pirate ship, duh, I think we have a plan.<br /> <br /> So, we will be positioning Alexia on shore, safely surrounded by a Warding Circle, to lift Pup Pid\u2019s ship from the sea. Well, control it to sail to shore. To see it, Jasmine will be moving underwater with a light. She will get skeletons attention, but only briefly if Alexia is quick when the boat gets moving. I hope she is careful, Jasmine is special to me.<br /> <br /> Whatever she thinks of me.<br /> <br /> I will use my Boneyard to trap incoming skeletons. It may take a lot of Plasm, but I am sure we can do it. Then we will use explosives to destroy most of them. Probably. Unless they decide Doc probably can control them. I am skeptical. They would not let me have my army of the dead anyway.<br /> <br /> Alexia has the gun within herself, and I think the plan is she will draw it for the Coup De Grace on Pup Pid, so he is unprepared. If he flees into the water, I am sure Jasmine can catch him, but hopefully it won\u2019t come to that.<br /> <br /> Should be an exciting battle, but I am super nervous about it.<br /> <br /> Doc summoned the Spirit Pup Pid tonight. We are pretty sure it is playing the role, as we understand it, once occupied by the ghost or Geist or whatever is in the Underworld now. We negotiated and got a token so he could be summoned again. He could be a sympathetic link to use our powers on Pup Pid from a safe distance. We may can inhibit him significantly.<br /> <br /> Unfortunately, the Spirit could tell us little more than local legends, which does indicate it is simply a Spirit which grew powerful aping the Ghost Pirate and generating some fear. We still don\u2019t know precisely who Pup Pid is, or was\u2026but if it is a Geist, it may not matter; like the Spirit, it may have become the legend more than the person it actually was.<br /> <br /> I am not normally real okay with bossing Spirits around unless they are causing trouble. Perhaps my time with Angelique has caused me to slip a little and become more laissiez-faire with that. That\u2019s not good; in fact that is two lines I have crossed today. Three, if you count disobeying my Domme while she is away, but this was harmless. But still, I need to reexamine my own code after this. Have I been too hard and unyielding before, or am I being the sort of amoral \u201cmy code is what I feel like even if it hurts people if they are bad people\u201d Pagan I have came to loathe so much?<br /> <br /> Now to put this away and get back over before Karen realizes I haven\u2019t dutifully had my ass in the air for the past forty-five minutes\u2026<br /> <br /> <i>End Session CLIX</i><br /> <br /> Heh, session clix.<br /> <br /> Doc was using Evocation Magic from <i>Second Sight</i>, Ceremonial Magic. This came up in discussion about Natalie practicing different Magic (she is a Hedge Witch). <br /> <br /> Karen Knight is 20, and we checked the local law is 21 to have a license. <br /> <br /> The \u201cNew Reverend\u201d is the fire Geist they have been ignoring for awhile, from the historically black church. <br /> <br /> The chant is from <i>Bedknobs and Broomsticks</i>. I remain aghast (aghast, I tell you) how many of my players have not seen it. And of course the Margaret Hamilton remark refers to <i>Wizard of Oz</i>. And the \u201cRobe and Wizard Hat\u201d was 8 years old when the game was set, so not anachronistic. <br /> <br /> Natalie did not need to make a Synergy check or anything, she was just considering.<br /> <br /> Okay that covers it, but as always Comments and Questions are welcome.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":56,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","user":"Baroness Nerak","date":". 06-12-2016, 04:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-13T15:58:48-07:00","id":913702,"title":"","content":"I thought of you doing an East Country accent is an amusing one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-14T18:52:28-07:00","id":914549,"title":"","content":"When did Karen learn magic?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>When will you rage?","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1405-anteros","name":"Anteros","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1405_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-14T19:10:42-07:00","id":914567,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Anteros</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play?p=914549#post914549\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">When did Karen learn magic?</div> </div> </div> </div>It was way back before Tavia became pregnant; when Karen felt that she wasn't contributing, Doc offered to teach her luck magic. That way, while she wasn't going to be a heavy hitter, she could still grant something to the group and help Doc and Simon during the very dangerous times that the outsiders tried to get through the paintings. It probably just hasn't come up a lot in the journals due to everything else that goes on in-game.<br /> <br /> Also, am I the only one who thought that Pud Pid's spirit would look like Gangplank's Spooky skin, from League of Legends?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-14T19:11:50-07:00","id":914568,"title":"","content":"Oh, right! Thanks!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>When will you rage?","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1405-anteros","name":"Anteros","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1405_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"661"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-14T22:01:16-07:00","id":914670,"title":"","content":"I say this a lot, but Taidragon is correct. Doc taught Karen Ceremonial Magic a whole back. <br /> <br /> I did a GIS for the skin and sure, he is more skeletal but that is pretty cool.<br /> <br /> One more session then a downtime until the Spring. 2011. Who knew?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-26T00:55:22-07:00","id":921395,"title":"","content":"The Middle Shadows Confront Pup Pid for the Underworld Oceanfront territory. Even bringing in Jasmine for back up. They battle the powerful Geist and their own power grows.<br /> <br /> This is the last session before a time skip. More after the session.<br /> <br /> <i>Session CLX</i><br /> <br /> <b>Sara\u2019s Letters</b><br /> <br /> Sara woke up to her wives arguing. Tensions had gotten a little high the night before, after Karen refused to serve as a scourge to Natalie\u2019s guilt, but Natalie had sublimated her frustration into the scene. But it hadn\u2019t faded away. Sara gave Karen an apologetic look and curled around Natalie, holding her tightly as she tried to sooth the strawberry scented woman with words instead of blows. It didn\u2019t address the underlying problem, but Sara was able to assuage Natalie\u2019s guilt, somewhat, and calm the crisis.<br /> <br /> Calm it enough at least that the trio joined the others for lunch. The ladies - Doc having eaten quickly and gone back to his Ceremony - were hanging out after and remarking amusedly on the many garlands of mistletoe that seemed to have popped up overnight when someone knocked on the door frame. Natalie perked up and rushed over to Jasmine, pulling her into a big hug. <br /> <br /> \u201cHello everyone. I am certainly glad to see you all again. And to know that you realize you can always call.\u201d<br /> <br /> Lily waved broadly at everyone, standing on tiptoes on Jasmine\u2019s shoulder. Karl filed in behind her, returning everyone\u2019s hugs in his awkward way. He smiled as they moved into the living room, commenting on the extent of his cousin\u2019s decorating.<br /> <br /> After a bit, Doc wandered in, carrying a small bag. As soon as she saw him, Lily hopped off the couch arm and tackled his leg. Doc patted her gently and picked her up, depositing her on his shoulder. Jasmine smiled slightly at the pair of them.<br /> <br /> \u201cLily has missed you.\u201d<br /> <br /> The reunited crew shared their various adventures, Jasmine beginning by telling the others the progress she\u2019d made concerning Bone Dry. Natalie sat close to her, a large smile on her face when Jasmine\u2019s story didn\u2019t call for some other expression. When she was done, Jasmine looked around, frowning slightly.<br /> <br /> \u201cWhere\u2019s the new girl?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cOn her way back from Sleeping Giant, I imagine.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cThere\u2019s been no... trouble.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cWell, if there is, do let me know.\u201d<br /> <br /> Alice arrived not too long later, with Eris in tow, a stubborn look on her face. Natalie grinned at her when she found them in the living room. <br /> <br /> \u201cSpooky\u2019s here!\u201d<br /> <br /> Jasmine and Alice were still wary of one another, but they nodded in greeting, and with everyone there, hashed out the final details of the plan.<br /> <br /> At some point, Troy had overheard them discussing the situation and asked if he could help. The shifted significant others had no intention of allowing their partners to face a ghost pirate without them, so with the six Sin-Eaters, their group numbered 10. The mood was serious as they moved down the path to the beach together. Sara avoided looking at the intense and violent expression on Troy\u2019s face, focusing on gathering suitable pieces of wood for Natalie\u2019s circle. She did manage a bright smile as she quietly teased Alice on her own, much better, gathering efforts.<br /> <br /> At the beach, the Sin-Eaters powered up and the were-creatures shifted as Natalie drew the circle in chalk on wood. As soon as she\u2019d activated her Manifestations, Jasmine slipped quietly into the water, getting in position to do her part as soon as the time came.<br /> <br /> Shortly after the warding circle flared into life, a half dozen skeletons walked up out of the ocean, looking towards the disturbance. Sara took up a defensive stance over Natalie and Doc\u2019s unconscious forms, Alexia next to her searching for a glimmer from Jasmine\u2019s light. The other 6, and Doc as the Dog of War, moved towards the skeletons.<br /> <br /> The two battle lines clashed right as the strong diver\u2019s light turned on. Alexia glanced at the fight, but managed to pull her attention away from the skeletons by force of will and began to raise the boat. The first clash ended with one less skeleton, it having fallen to Troy\u2019s axe as he glowed a blood red. The other skeletons were all worse for the wear, while the krewe was unharmed.<br /> <br /> The next clash saw an end to the other five, with two more newly emerging from the ocean\u2019s spray. They were distracted, marveling at the sight of the galleon\u2019s arrival into the shallow waters. They never noticed Alice leap forward, landing with a splash, her axe biting deep into one of their skulls. Her axe trailed a salty spray as she followed up with a swing towards the second. By that point, Troy had arrived and finished the skeleton off, the red light fading around him.<br /> <br /> Jasmine beat the boat to shore, joining the group as they retreated further up the beach, staying within Natalie\u2019s circle. She looked at them seriously.<br /> <br /> \u201cThere\u2019s a really big fish following the boat. I mean, bigger than the boat.\u201d<br /> <br /> Sara\u2019s eyes widened as she looked the sizable galleon over, swallowing as she noticed the swarm of skeletons pouring out of it. Doc began passing out explosives, instructing the combat group how to set them up. Jasmine raised an eyebrow, a slight smile playing over her lips.<br /> <br /> \u201cSorry, Doc, I didn\u2019t realize this was a reconnaissance mission.\u201d<br /> <br /> He glared at her, but it was softened by his own smile. Natalie sprung the trap as soon as the bulk of the skeletons were a suitable distance from the boat, freezing all of them in place. The others set the explosives quickly and with a bang, evened the odds.<br /> <br /> Natalie shifted closer to Sara as the Dog of War turned to her.<br /> <br /> \u201cThere\u2019s 8 skeletons and Pup Pid, focusing on something, waiting in ambush. Doc - the Dog won\u2019t fit.\u201d<br /> <br /> He nodded and returned to his usual body. Sara stayed with Natalie as the rest of them boarded the ship in true pirate style. Even Alexia, though she lagged behind, staying out of sight until it came time for her to do her part with Pup Pid\u2019s Bane.<br /> <br /> They found two skeletons bodily blocking the doorway into the room Natalie had directed them to. Jasmine and Alice were in the lead and Jasmine reacted first, elbowing the one in front of her and throwing it to the ground. Noriko struck around Alice to get at the other, dodging out of the way as Doc lit it on fire. As the flames smouldered, Alice shouldered it further into the room, finishing it off with a solid swing once she had space.<br /> <br /> She stumbled at the end of the swing, coughing up brackish water. She fell to her hands and knees, trying to get rid of the water that had replaced the air in her lungs. Eris bounded in after her and howled, shifting into her Gauru form and clawing at Pup Pid.<br /> <br /> The rest of the skeletons focused on Eris, whose wounds knit themselves with startling quickness. The krewe focused on Pup Pid, with Troy drawing on the mystical powers of the axe to hit the supernaturally evasive geist, Natalie using her Boneyard to directly consume his corpus and Jasmine disappearing and striking unexpectedly to great effect.<br /> <br /> Sara stood close to Natalie, knuckles white around her stone knife as Natalie described the fight in mumbles. The tattooed girl gasped when a large shadow approached the boat with startling quickness and nudged it, causing it to rock on the sandy seabed. Natalie quickly reassured her that while Troy and Karl had lost their footing momentarily, it did not have the effect that Pup Pid had likely wanted.<br /> <br /> Jasmine had not stumbled, and went in for her second blow, wrenching the pirate ghost\u2019s neck around. She felt his corpus fade, and called out. <br /> <br /> \u201cAlexia! Now!\u201d<br /> <br /> Alexia stood and raised the old fashioned pistol, screwing her eyes almost shut. But her aim was true and she fired quickly. The geist dissipated, leaving his hat to fall to the ground. Jasmine reappeared, dusting off her hands.<br /> <br /> As soon as Natalie told her the fight was over and dropped the Boneyard, Sara pulled her to her feet, then along the beach towards the boat. She watched the shadow under the water move away, almost as if fleeing their approach. She ignored it and they climbed quickly, bursting into the inner room.<br /> <br /> They found the walls covered in claw marks and Noriko screaming at Doc in Japanese, as he coughed out the last of the water in his own lungs. Eris appeared clam, sitting close to Alice who was breathing deeply. Sara looked around, confirming that no one seemed seriously hurt, and sighed in relief.<br /> <br /> \u201cDoubloons!\u201d<br /> <br /> Alexia took off, leaving behind the remaining scattered bone pieces to search the ship. Doc got up carefully, joining her with Noriko and Natalie right behind.<br /> <br /> They returned after not too long, without any pirate treasure. They did have a pair of statues they\u2019d found in Pup Pid\u2019s room, a slick black model of a heart and an obsidian statue of a tropical fish. Natalie explained that she thought they were what Pup Pid had used to control the large fish. Alexia\u2019s eyes lit up as the strawberry scented woman went on to point out that the fish had not been some kind of ghost, and she asked if it could be Fishbourne related. Jasmine shook her head.<br /> <br /> \u201cIt didn\u2019t look anything like Tavia or Karl\u2019s fish form.\u201d<br /> <br /> Alexia made a face, while Sara\u2019s eyebrows went up at the mention of Tavia\u2019s fish form. The krewe did decide to take the statues home anyway. As they left, Doc\u2019s eyes lit on the hat the captain had left behind. Jasmine frowned as he picked it up.<br /> <br /> \u201cI don\u2019t think it\u2019s a good idea to keep that.\u201d<br /> <br /> Doc dropped in onto his head, pushing it back as it fell over his eyes.<br /> <br /> \u201cSuit yourself.\u201d<br /> <br /> The krewe tied the boat up to one of the quays and began for him. Jasmine, Karl and Natalie split off to check in at the lighthouse before they left the beach. As the others stepped into the real world, Karen scanned the group, jumping to her feet, her eyes wide.<br /> <br /> \u201cSomeone\u2019s missing...\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cWho?! Oh, right. Natalie, Jasmine and Karl went to the lighthouse.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cFine.\u201d<br /> <br /> She sat back down, eyes fixed on the portal. After Karen shut down Doc\u2019s attempts to reassure her, Sara shooed everyone along, giving Karen a reassuring squeeze as they left her in peace.<br /> <br /> The krewe followed Alexia into the kitchen, pitching in to prep for celebratory homemade pizza. Alice smiled mischievously at Doc as she sliced pepperoni.<br /> <br /> \u201cSo, Doc, what\u2019s a pirate's favorite letter?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201c...arrr?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cNo, it\u2019s the sea!\u201d<br /> <br /> Doc rolled his eyes at her twice, once for the question and once for the answer. They waited for the others to show up to start cooking, but as soon as Natalie, Karen, Jasmine and Karl walked up from the Gate room, Alexia put the pizzas in the over. Karen stood close to Natalie, she squeezed her waist gently.<br /> <br /> \u201cIt\u2019s important for you all to know that Karen was definitely not crying.\u201d<br /> <br /> Sara smiled tenderly at the two of them, kissing Karen softly on the forehead. The krewe chatted comfortably until and through dinner, sharing stories, Christmas plans and laughs until it came time for Jasmine and Karl to return home, for awhile.<br /> <br /> <b><br /> Natalie\u2019s Tweets</b><br /> <br /> December 10th, 2010<br /> <br /> We managed to defeat Pup Pid, who turned out to be a powerful Geist. He certainly had a small army of ghosts, but they were freed when he was defeated. We kept to our plan, with Alexia in the circle raising the ship from the deeps, my trapping ghosts with Boneyard and Doc destroying the ghosts trapped. Eris, Noriko, Karl and Troy were backing us up, and we had both Alice and Spooky. <br /> <br /> With that done, there was the raid on the ship, which was made difficult by narrow spaces and Pup Pid using Tear Stained Rage on both Doc and Alice, and Eris all but frenzying (and Noriko flipping out). But even with a number of Ghosts, Pup Pid was a Geist fighting six Sin-Eaters, Three Shapeshifters, and a Ghost. He did have an impressive sea monster of some sort he was unable to bring to bear. Who knows what that thing was?<br /> <br /> More important, Spooky was here for the mission! We got to hang out before going, and she looked like she was doing great! Well, great as Spooky goes anyway. I mean, she smiled a couple times. She and Karl are very happy! I admit it was really nice to see her again. I hung out with her as much as she would tolerate, which was a fair amount I admit.<br /> <br /> Karen and I had a fight over her not punishing me hard enough for my using mind control powers and allowing a Spirit summoning. We just fought about this after the whole Bale Hound thing, and it was upsetting to see it happening again. I just wish she would give the castigation and purgation that would bring me peace. I guess there is always Heroin.<br /> <br /> But it\u2019s a good day. We defeated a menace in the Underworld, claimed territory, and I get to hang out with Spooky. Time to focus on that.<br /> <br /> Ta!<br /> <br /> --<br /> <br /> <b> Home for Christmas</b><br /> <br /> Natalie Lousler sat in the sun room, watching the water outside. Her mother would arrive soon, and not be happy with her. Sure enough, she heard boots coming down the hallway, away from the chorus of women\u2019s voices.<br /> <br /> \u201cNatalie\u2026.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cOh, hi Mom. How are you,\u201d The younger girl put her phone down.<br /> <br /> The monochromatic elder stepped in. \u201cYou got suspended. What happened?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cSo\u2026did I mention I had a girlfriend?\u201d The younger girl smiled brightly. \u201cWell, had, till she also got suspended.\u201d<br /> <br /> Natalie Knight raised an eyebrow. \u201cWithout telling me? For how long?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cOh, most of lunch at least.\u201d<br /> <br /> The older women walked around where the younger girl was sitting. \u201cYou got caught kissing?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cYeah.\u201d<br /> <br /> The Mother turned around, \u201cI am very sorry, that is awful. You will be out of this backwards state soon enough and\u2026\u201d<br /> <br /> Younger Natalie sighed. \u201cOkay. Maybe not just kissing.\u201d<br /> <br /> A raised eyebrow.<br /> <br /> \u2018I was helping her find something that dropped into her skirt!\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cOh son of a bitch!\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cDaughter.\u201d<br /> <br /> --<br /> <br /> \u201cI can\u2019t believe you were okay with your mother saying grace for us. It\u2019s like you are growing as a person.\u201d<br /> <br /> Karen Knight grinned as she looked out the window. She had always wondered what Natalie\u2019s bedroom that she had grown up in was like. In truth, she had been looking forward to this. Natalie had once lingered in hers, after all, when she lived at home.<br /> <br /> \u201cI permitted the owner of the residence we are staying in to choose the deity to whom we dedicate our breaking of bread,\u201d Natalie was drying her hair with one towel, a second wrapped around her. <br /> <br /> \u201cWell she was okay with us sharing a room,\u201d Karen smiled. She could see a lighthouse in the distance, light sweeping across the sea. It was neat, like something out of a portrait.<br /> <br /> \u201cWe are married.\u201d Natalie said as if correcting her.<br /> <br /> \u201cWell, Sara is not legally married to us, and we haven\u2019t had a ceremony yet. But she still let the three of us share a room.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cYou will get your public ceremony, I promised you,\u201d Natalie ran a brush through her hair.<br /> <br /> \u201cI think when Tatum gets here after Boxing Day she is staying in the spare room. It is all prepped.,\u201d Karen smiled as she heard the water turn off; Sara was done with her shower. She looked at a cross on the wall Natalie had made when she was six. <br /> <br /> \u201cUnfortunately. She is still a bit old fashioned.\u201d Natalie frowned slightly at Karen looking at her cross.<br /> <br /> \u201cOr she plans to make it easier to seduce her herself.\u201d<br /> <br /> Natalie whirled around, \u201cShe wouldn\u2019t dare!\u201d<br /> <br /> Sara was standing in the doorway wearing a towel around her waist and hair, a confused look on her face, \u201cWhat wouldn\u2019t I dare?\u201d<br /> <br /> --<br /> <br /> Natalie Knight opened her eyes to see Sara looking right at her. She was smiling.<br /> <br /> \u201cTatum gets here today!\u201d<br /> <br /> Natalie sat up in bed once Sara moved her head. She was still unused to waking in her old room. It was strange. She looked at her wife. <br /> <br /> \u201cWhen is she getting here?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cWe are picking her up about three. It will be something of a drive to the airport so\u2026\u201d<br /> <br /> Natalie stretched, looking over at Sara, \u201cYeah, we need to get off our asses and find a good haunt shortcut.\u201d<br /> <br /> Sara smirked at her wife. \u201cI may have already found one, out walking on the beach.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cReally?\u201d Natalie\u2019s eyes widened, blue and green looked at her wife. <br /> <br /> \u201cWell yea, I was out walking when that rain shower hit, and a cute couple I was talking to took shelter for a bit with me. That unused beach house a couple blocks down has a very weak haunt in it.\u201d<br /> <br /> Natalie was smirking slightly now, her eyebrow raised<br /> <br /> \u201c\u2026And very squeaky floors.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cDon\u2019t ever change, Sara, \u201c The Goth looked down, then up. \u201cWait how did you get in, and know it was empty?\u201d<br /> <br /> Sara\u2019s eyes were dancing. <br /> <br /> \u201cNatalie told me. She had been there before.\u201d<br /> <br /> Natalie rested her face in her hands. \u201cOh apple, if you were not going to fall far, could you have at least rolled a bit?\u201d<br /> <br /> --<br /> <br /> \u201cThis is wonderful. I love having the house full of people again.\u201d<br /> <br /> Julie smiled at her daughter. Natalie smirked back.<br /> <br /> \u201cBut we don\u2019t have a bunch of guys drinking beer and watching football loudly in the living room.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cIt\u2019s true, and that is my favorite part of your orientation,\u201d Now it was Julie\u2019s turn to smirk. <br /> <br /> \u201cAnd the fact they are gorgeous women probably does not bother you either.\u201d<br /> <br /> Julie chuckled. \u201cI am much more pleased there is no fighting, even with Tatum here. I am not sure you were aware of how much arguing went on. It was ugly at times, and it was why I stopped hosting here, to be honest with you.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cAh, I wondered.\u201d Natalie looked at her sympathetically. \u201cBill and John?\u201d<br /> <br /> Julie rolled her eyes. \u201cThey were part of the problem. Lord give me patience they were obnoxious when together. But also your nieces when adolescence hit. They would not stop trying to outdo each other, and snapped at each other constantly.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cOh that\u2019s right,\u201d A manicured nail tapped Natalie\u2019s check. \u201cI remember avoiding them.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cI thought at first that was a shame, \u201c Julie frowned. But then she started to grin. \u201cNow I think that might have been for the best\u2026\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cMOM!\u201d<br /> <br /> --<br /> <br /> Natalie Knight sat in her tankini top, which had an appearance of lace, on the beach near the house. It was black of course, like everything else she wore; the sun was setting and the high tide meant the water surrounded her with each wave\u2019s arrival. Pretty much everywhere Natalie had lived was near the ocean. She liked it that way. Behind her another woman with shorter hair walked up. \u201cNat, you okay?\u201d<br /> <br /> Natalie looked behind her at Tatum. \u201cYea, come over and sit down! \u201c<br /> <br /> Tatum found a rock a few feet back. She was less eager to have the sea crash over her than Natalie was. \u201cI wanted to thank you for bringing me down here. Your mom is like, super nice, and your house looks like something out of a painting.<br /> <br /> Natalie turned and gave her a thin-lipped smile, \u201cThanks. Glad you are enjoying it.\u201d<br /> <br /> Tatum crouched forward. \u201cYou\u2019re not.\u201d<br /> <br /> Natalie turned back to look at the sea. \u201cI have complicated feelings about this place. I left twelve years ago vowing to never return. One more broken promise.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cLike shooting yourself? That\u2019s not a bad thing, Natalie. That is a sign you are not the same girl you were then. You are not the same girl you were this time last year, from what I am told.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cNo, I suppose I am not.\u201d She did not look back. \u201cIt\u2019s a good thing. Mostly. A lot has happened.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cSo\u2026are you okay?\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cYes\u2026seeing Mom and Natalie again\u2026it\u2019s unreal. It\u2019s like I can\u2019t believe it is happening. Being here is like a dream. But\u2026not like, a dream romance, or like a nightmare. More\u2026,\u201d she looked back then forward. \u201cSurreal.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cAs you say.\u201d<br /> <br /> There was a long silence, and then Tatum rose. <br /> <br /> \u201cI am gonna head back to the house. I was promised more chocolate chip cookies.\u201d<br /> <br /> Natalie smiled. \u201cOkay, be careful, it\u2019s easy to trip. Love you.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cLove you too!\u201d<br /> <br /> Natalie looked back out to sea. The sun had nearly finished setting. An hour after darkness fell, she rose and returned, one more key on her belt.<br /> <br /> --<br /> <br /> <br /> <i>End Session CLX</i><br /> <br /> Big battle, most is pretty clear. Pup Pid was a powerful Geist with the Stigmata and Tear Stained Keys. He wound up creating a Deathmask Doc inherited. Alice and Alexia failed their Synergy checks, Natalie, Sara, Doc and Jasmine passed.<br /> <br /> We are moving ahead to the spring, with some RP of the next few months going on next game. Unfortunately, this was the last session with Alice/Jasmine\u2019s player. There is a lot going on in their life, and they felt this was a good point to call their role finished. Alice will be in Sleeping Giant, however. After some discussion, Natalie, Sara, Doc and Alexia will be sticking with it. We have no current plans to add any players at this time. Doc's player cannot guarantee logs due to life events, but will do them when he can. Those remaining are excited to move ahead several months and see what adventures we find. I hope you will join us.<br /> <br /> New Session in two weeks. See you then. Comments and Questions welcome.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-26T21:37:50-07:00","id":921844,"title":"","content":"The battle sounds like it was a big, fun affair, and a nice event to send off Alice/Jasmine's player, just as you guys did Simon's previously. It's cool to see how the characters' big fights are growing bigger and bigger in scale, and increasingly more one-sided against their foes. Also, loved the reconnaissance mission reference there. Feels a bit odd to realize that you guys will be playing with half of your original players though.<br /> <br /> Just as with Jasmine before her, it's a bit sad that Alice and her plot-threads are going to be effectively gone now, even if in-universe they're still there. However, I was wrong to call it a shame before that Jasmine was gone from the krewe; Jasmine and Alice's stories are effectively completed and though the characters perhaps haven't gotten over their respective strifes, it's unreasonable to assume they would. Jasmine is going to take literally years to properly get over Richard's death, even with Karl being in her life, and Alice is going to still have the Grasping Huntress' brand of crazy stuck in the back of her head until Alice resolves her condition as a Sin Eater. However, they've both bonded well with the rest of the krewe and formed understandings if not close friendships, they've forged strong, personal relationships with others that will likely last the rest of their lives (ironically both times with were-beings) and have gotten quite strong. It makes sense that their player feels like their stories didn't have anywhere else to go without being shoehorned.<br /> <br /> Here's hoping that the game goes well after this departure, and that Alice/Jasmine's player (and all the players really) find their lives going well after this.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-26T22:47:23-07:00","id":921862,"title":"","content":"Thanks, am glad you enjoyed.<br /> <br /> I will see Jasmine/Alice's player still in a Mutants &amp; Masterminds game I am playing (not running) so we are still seeing each other. It is a very new game. I was hoping to do more with Jasmine and especially Alice, but my plans can be modified.<br /> <br /> Our lives are good. Doc's player has a lot going on but made the game, albeit late. Tonight we kicked off several plots; not having the impending downtime meant starting new stuff. Join us to see the students at Alexia's school take on their own first case, discussion of the Sin-Eater Coffee finally arriving in the city, and the decision to search for Rawl. Also a game of not strip Uno, however much Chandra tries.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-27T01:05:20-07:00","id":921887,"title":"","content":"And now I imagine Sin-Eater Coffee either involving a brew with people involved ala soylent green, or one where the coffee beans were harvested and or processed from the underworld. The tagline could even be &quot;It's so strong it keeps the dead up at night&quot;.<br /> <br /> Mind, drinking it probably makes you light up like a beacon to all nearby ghosts, but who says that's a bad thing?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5803-taidragon","name":"Taidragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5803_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1038"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-27T02:08:26-07:00","id":921904,"title":"","content":"Coffee is her name. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> (Though you could probably make a Ceremony...)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The Conspiracy of Hrad \u010cern\u00e1 Hora</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/13838-scion-bohemian-front-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Scion: Bohemian Front</a>][<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/99033-changeling-malibu-dream-house-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling: Malibu Dream House</a>] [<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/268069-demon-night-train-detective-agency-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">Demon: Night Train Detective Agency</a>] <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/la94fvk\" target=\"_blank\">[WoD: The Golden Eagle</a>]","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/56-baroness-nerak","name":"Baroness Nerak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar56_2.jpeg","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2524"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-03T12:00:45-07:00","id":925444,"title":"","content":"Change is and to all things a time.<br /> <br /> It was a good send off.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/490-omenseer","name":"omenseer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar490_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"987"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-10T01:34:43-07:00","id":929116,"title":"","content":"Thanks Omenseer<br /> <br /> Spring has sprung and New Haven is beginning to thaw. Let\u2019s hearken back to the heady days of April 2011!<br /> <br /> <i>Session CLXI</i><br /> <br /> <b>Sara\u2019s Stories</b><br /> <br /> It was a sunny Monday afternoon when Sara, Karen, Natalie and Tatum\u2019s plane touched down. Noriko and Tavia saw the group first and hurried over to greet them. After the initial warm greetings, Tatum caught sight of her parents. Sara went with her when she stepped away to wave them over.<br /> <br /> Sara introduced herself, flirting shamelessly with the pair of them. Tatum hid her face.<br /> <br /> \u201cWe should have the three of you over for dinner sometime.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cAnd perhaps after dinner...\u201d<br /> <br /> Sara grinned wickedly as Tatum linked arms with her parents and all but dragged them away from the tattooed girl.<br /> <br /> -----------------------------------------<br /> <br /> \u201cI know you just got back, but the kids asked to meet with us. I thought you guys might want to come along.\u201d<br /> <br /> They had, so it was the whole krewe who met with Bart and the students in one of the classrooms at Albertus Magnus. The new arrivals caused something of a splash - Deanna immediately ran up to give Natalie a big hug, earning her a dark look from Sarah, and the twins both gave Sara a shy smile, studiously ignoring each other. Sara smiled broadly back at them, then spared a glance for Marie. Alexia had been giving the krewe updates, and had commented that the witch had a serious crush on Tracey. Marie was absorbed in her notes, a serious look on her have, and hadn\u2019t seemed to notice the other girl\u2019s interest in Sara.<br /> <br /> After the general chatter of greetings died down, Marie stood and cleared her throat.<br /> <br /> \u201cTo start this off, this is a serious situation. Not a drill, alright? You guys that go here might have heard that a student disappeared. I\u2019ve been looking into it, and I think it will be a way to use our powers for good.\u201d<br /> <br /> The missing girl\u2019s name was Katie Hong. She had a K-pop radio show, Saturday nights at 1 AM and the Saturday before, a different girl had shown up, saying that Katie was feeling sick and had asked her to run the show for her. She hadn\u2019t been seen since, Katie or this mystery substitute.<br /> <br /> To be fair, no one knew who the substitute was. The \u2018goober\u2019 who had the slot just before her said it was \u2018some other Japanese girl who played Japanese music\u2019, despite Katie and her music both being Korean. Susan, a friend of Katie\u2019s that Marie had been talking to, had called into the show to ask after her and been brushed off with a story about how they\u2019d met at a party that Susan hadn\u2019t attended.<br /> <br /> The other lead Maria had considered was Katie\u2019s roommate. She\u2019d been out of town all weekend, and from accounts they weren\u2019t particularly close, but she might know something. The krewe, and the other students, listened intently. When Marie was done, Sara spoke up, asking if the radio kept recordings of the shows. Marie said she didn\u2019t know, but would get on it.<br /> <br /> Alexia focused on getting everyone involved. Deanna volunteered to talk to Susan some more.<br /> <br /> \u201cI don\u2019t have superpowers, but I\u2019m a good talker.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cBeing friends is sometimes its own superpower.\u201d<br /> <br /> Alexia gave the enthusiastic girl a wide smile. Sara smiled as well, and suggested she ask if the song the substitute claimed was Katie\u2019s favorite actually was. Timothy asked if the \u2018goober\u2019 would respond better talking to another guy. Marie shrugged.<br /> <br /> \u201cI think a cuter girl than me with more... showing would get further. I just talked with him on the phone.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cDon\u2019t be so hard on yourself.\u201d<br /> <br /> Sarah patted her on the shoulder and Tracey nodded agreement. Sara smiled at the three of them and suggested Marie go with Deanna, to see if a sketch might help. When Alexia suggested physically searching the station, the students looked sheepishly at each other until Timothy shrugged and volunteered.<br /> <br /> Tracey offered to talk with Katie\u2019s roommate, leaving Clarissa looking to the side awkwardly. Deanna thrust her hand in the air, one finger extended.<br /> <br /> \u201cAha! I\u2019ve had a moment of brilliance!\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cCould you take this seriously?\u201d<br /> <br /> Deanna smiled at Marie, then at Clarissa, reminding her she had a number for a cop who might be willing to help. The psychic balked a little at what she called taking advantage of a crazy grandfather cop, but eventually agreed to talk with him.<br /> <br /> The tasks divvied up, Sara exhorted them to call for backup if things got to looking dangerous. Timothy gave her a look, but she met his gaze seriously and they all agreed eventually. Once they did, Alexia clapped her hands and beamed.<br /> <br /> \u201cAlright guys. Keep your eyes open and stay frosty!\u201d<br /> <br /> Natalie and Sara looked at each other, confusion on their faces. But the students all smiled and nodded and broke up into smaller groups. Sarah collared Natalie immediately, pulling her into a different room. Sara smirked at them and went to sit between Tracey and Timothy. Marie sighed.<br /> <br /> \u201cIt\u2019s like herding cats.\u201d<br /> <br /> Deanna patted her on the shoulder, a serious look on her face.<br /> <br /> \u201cLet them have their fun - it\u2019s a hard day tomorrow.\u201d<br /> <br /> The competition between the twins got fierce as Sara flirted with both of them, and they wound up inviting her back to their place - for coffee, from him and ice cream, from her - simultaneously. When Timothy spilled creamer on his shirt and had to take it off, Tracey looked between Sara and her brother and rolled her eyes in mild annoyance, leaving before things went further.<br /> <br /> The next morning Tracey came back just as Sara was leaving. She smirked at the tattooed woman and stretched.<br /> <br /> \u201cRebecca Stein, Katie\u2019s roommate, doesn\u2019t know anything about her disappearance - she was out of town - but she is good in the sack.\u201d<br /> <br /> Sara smiled approvingly and gave her a hug and a kiss goodbye before heading out to return to the Bluffs for lunch.<br /> <br /> ---------------------------------------<br /> <br /> After lunch, Natalie called the krewe together to let them know Coffee would be arriving in the next few days. While they talked about that, and filled each other in on their winters, Doc mentioned he also hadn\u2019t heard from Rawl since the incident with Bone Shadow.<br /> <br /> Sara looked at him in concern, then at the others.<br /> <br /> \u201cDo you know of a way to look for him? I don\u2019t know how, we don\u2019t have anything to use for the Finding ritual, but...\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cUnless we find a ghost... no!\u201d<br /> <br /> Doc\u2019s eyes lit up and he explained that he could summon a tracking spirit. As the group broke apart to prepare, Natalie touched Doc\u2019s shoulder and gestured towards a side room.<br /> <br /> After a bit, Natalie came out a few shades paler, and went straight for the drinks cabinet. Sara looked at her with concern but the strawberry scented woman smiled wanly at her. Doc looked a little shell shocked himself, but quickly went about gathering what he needed, including a picture of Rawl, Xerxes and the bone Alexia used in the Finding ritual. He also made a sketch of the lean man\u2019s werewolf form.<br /> <br /> The spirit responded quickly, its canid form looking at Doc quizzically.<br /> <br /> \u201cWe would like your help in finding this man. He\u2019s not been heard from in many months and is a friend.\u201d<br /> <br /> \u201cWhere was he seen last? I will do my best to find him and return to you.\u201d<br /> <br /> The group waited for a time, Sara sitting close to Natalie and biting her lip. The spirit returned looking tired and moved to rest in front of Doc again, looking up at him.<br /> <br /> \u201cThe man is alive and in Glenwood. I can take you there.\u201d<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>Natalie\u2019s Diary</b><br /> <br /> March 20th, 2011<br /> The Vernal Equinox, when Winter fades before Spring\u2019s fecundity<br /> A Sunday<br /> Malibu, California USA<br /> <br /> As of today, Chastity Allison Lousler lives again. I am her, and she is me. I am still Natalie Knight, but I feel whole again, her cross has retaken its familiar place against my breast, if below my clothes. I am still Pagan, but that symbol reminds me of who I once was, who I am not running from anymore.<br /> <br /> I dug up her \u201ccoffin\u201d from under the tree on my Malibu property, with my wives watching. Karen filmed it. It was beautiful, I wept.<br /> <br /> When I go back, I go back a woman at peace. This was my first entry of 2011. I hope the rest are so upbeat.<br /> <br /> <br /> April 5th, 2011<br /> New Haven, Connecticut, USA<br /> <br /> I am back in Connecticut. It is still too cold. I hoped returning later than the Vernal Equinox would help; it was 16 days ago and it is still too cold. I hear there was snow a week ago. It\u2019s Spring!<br /> <br /> We got back with little difficulty. It was good to see everyone again. I admit a bit of disappointment neither Alice nor Spooky were there, but they have made themselves a bit scarce, as I understand it. But the arrival was smooth, bumpiest part was Sara flirting with Tatum\u2019s parents, and them flirting back.<br /> <br /> We had only a short time, before meeting the kids. Marie Bourbon, Clarissa Walthstone, Deanna James, Sarah Jameson, Timothy Lowe, and Tracy Lowe were waiting to meet. I got a big hug and a chaste kiss on the head from Deanna, and a smoldering glance by Sarah. Marie gave us little time to wait before diving in.<br /> <br /> A Korean girl, Katie Hong, is missing, and there are peculiar circumstances. A friend, unknown to her clique, filled in on her radio show very late Saturday Night. She has not been seen that we know of since Friday. The group divided roles and set out. Some faster than others.<br /> <br /> When the meeting broke up I found myself alone in a classroom with a certain Banshee. She kissed me, and while her hands explored, her hair seemed to be helping. I felt it coil around my breasts and against my skin, as she looked deeply into my eyes.<br /> <br /> I guess the whole not getting involved with students was a nice idea while it lasted.<br /> <br /> We wound up in my townhouse, where I discovered just how much control she has over all that hair now. Suffice to say, this was absolutely not the last night she and I will be spending together. I felt a little guilty the next morning, but she seemed utterly pleased with herself.<br /> <br /> I think everyone is here now, so I need to talk about Coffee\u2026and maybe talk to Doc.<br /> <br /> <br /> April 5th, 2011<br /> <br /> Okay, so they now know Coffee is coming, and we have decided to go to Glenwood (In town less than forty-eight fucking ours, and my curvy ass will be in Glenwood again. If I hadn\u2019t just had a Banshee tongue in it I would be beyond pissed) to find Rawl, aka that cute evil Werewolf. However, to cut through the bullshit, Doc summoned a Hound Spirit to track Rawl down. We are headed out shortly. Okay.<br /> <br /> I talked to Doc about the baby. I sprung it right on him, of course, because I am a harridan. I know I am torn; I want to have a baby, and I think I shouldn\u2019t. If I have one, he is one of the few men I would willingly join my genes with to bring a child into the world. He is a good man. But it is a mess. Our relationship is over, and while attracted to each other I think we both feel relief at that. We are such good friends. But biological clocks are such nuisances, and after running out on Natalie I feel a need to prove I can raise a fucking child. Is it worth getting pregnant? Is this something I really want to do? No takebacks.<br /> <br /> Goddess, this is eating me up inside. I don\u2019t need to decide now. I don\u2019t need to decide tomorrow. Hardest part is done. Now we can try to relax. Maybe.<br /> <br /> So I am going to Glenwood, and I am thinking about babies. This is not how I wanted my first full day back to turn out.<br /> <br /> <i>End Session CLXI</i><br /> <br /> Mostly this was RP. Doc used Evocation from Second Sight to summon the Spirit.<br /> <br /> Just about everything was covered. There was an Uno game between Karen, Alexia, Chandra and Catherine that Chandra wanted to turn into \u201cStrip Uno,\u201d but despite her attempts (and getting Catherine to her side) Alexia overruled her (Karen stayed neutral). It was a funny scene.<br /> <br /> So an an experiment, I am having the PCs guide their group of Psychics and Thaumaturges solving a mystery! Of course, they may need all the help they can get. If you have forgotten\u2026<br /> <br /> Marie Bourbon is a Hedge Witch. She is Sarah\u2019s roommate who tried to \u201cprotect\u201d her in the Banshee storyline.<br /> <br /> Deanna James is not supernatural at all. She is Clarissa\u2019s best friend, had a fling with Natalie, may think she is Batman. May. She has shown up a lot.<br /> <br /> Sarah Jameson is a Banshee, which seems a semi-unique supernatural creature capable of seeing ghosts and predicting death. Also hair that is completely under her control, but can be ensorcelled by her comb. The focus of the Banshee storyline.<br /> <br /> Timothy Lowe is Mage, but not formally trained. Has a magic Dream Island, Sara\u2019s attention.<br /> <br /> Tracy Lowe is also a Mage, also not formally trained. She also has the magic dream island and Sara\u2019s attention.<br /> <br /> Clarissa Walthstone is a Telekinetic who is capable of some truly amazing lifting powers when angry. Her telekinetic strength seems tied to emotional state. She can also make physical objects explode from vibrating. Still not sure the extent of her abilities, but enraged meltdowns seem to unlock new powers. Has shown up a lot.<br /> <br /> That is the Underwater Story Weaving club. Let\u2019s see how well they can do this.<br /> <br /> Last note, Coffee came up as coming awhile back, but then Jasmine was swapped for Alice, and I did not want her to show while the Krewe had a new member. Then we got near enough time I want to jump to spring, so she is only now appearing. But if it seems familiar that is why.<br /> <br /> Okay I think that is everything. Comments and Questions welcome","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/OnyxGraphics/OnyxMod.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Onyx Path Moderator </span><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\">Forum Rules</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#FF0000\">This is my mod voice.</span> This is my goth voice.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/15731-geist-balance-of-shadows-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\">[Geist: Balance of Shadows</a><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/17537-v20-the-conspiracy-of-hrad-%C4%8Dern%C3%A1-hora-actual-play\" target=\"_blank\"> ][ Vampire: The C